 236:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Egtm/Std/IfxEgtm_Tim.h ****                         * 00- State is 0 (ignore write access)
 237:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Egtm/Std/IfxEgtm_Tim.h ****                         * 01- Change state to 0
